# Paths Warden should skip when scanning this repository.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore (see docs/DECISIONS/0006-file-walker-and-format-detection.md
# for what M2 supports). Negation patterns are not honored in M2.

# Test fixtures contain intentional payloads (Unicode threats, prompt-
# injection samples). They are scanned by the targeted test suites in
# packages/core/tests, not by the repo-wide `warden scan .`.
tests/fixtures/

# Bun's binary lockfile — opaque, not agent context.
bun.lock

# The bootstrap prompt is a verbatim record of how this project was kicked
# off, not agent context to be scanned in-place.
warden-bootstrap-prompt.md
